Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.17,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Auditing embedded C firmware in Windows PowerShell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:08.44,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,All 16 automated unit tests pass in 8.7 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:12.72,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,GCC firmware confirms 100% bit-accurate decision parity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:16.99,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Launching clinical telemetry gateway on port 8000...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:23.57,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 1: Clean Normal Sinus Rhythm (250 Hz dual-stream scope).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:29.14,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Untouched raw signal displayed alongside candidate-filtered ECG.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:34.71,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,All quality heuristics pass, MIG distortion zero -> ACCEPT triage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:43.86,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 2: Atrial Fibrillation with irregular intervals and f-waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:52.00,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,1D-CNN classifies rhythm on hardware FPU in 34 ms -> ACCEPT AF.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:59.38,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 3: Ventricular Ectopy and Premature Ventricular Contractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:05.75,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Ectopic morphology flagged; raw snippet preserved in 8 MB PSRAM.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:13.34,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 4: Severe Respiratory Drift (Ambulatory Baseline Wander).
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:19.93,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Linear-time quality gate flags wander -> Safely issues ABSTAIN.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:26.63,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 5: High-Frequency Muscle Tremor & EMG Artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:32.33,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Quality gate isolates noise -> Routes recording to REVIEW for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.43,0:01:38.73,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 6: Disconnected Electrode / Flatline Simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.83,0:01:44.12,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Zero amplitude detected -> Immediate ABSTAIN (Zero false reassurance).
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:50.60,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 7: ADC Rail Saturation Clipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:56.08,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Amplifier rail limits exceeded -> Immediate ABSTAIN to protect AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:02:02.50,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 8: Morphology Integrity Guard (MIG) in Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:07.92,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Filter attenuates pacemaker spike -> MIG detects discrepancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:13.34,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Automatic acceptance revoked -> Safely forced to REVIEW.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:23.79,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Summary: 85.5% coverage, zero missed arrhythmias, 16/16 tests passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:33.24,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,100% bit-accurate firmware parity, $14.10 BOM, 20.7h battery lifetime.
